# Cross-origin isolation lets Pyodide interrupt running code via SharedArrayBuffer.
# Every asset must be same-origin or send CORP/CORS headers (site/AGENTS.md).
# script-src/style-src are set per page by Astro (astro.config.mjs → security.csp);
# frame-ancestors cannot be set from a meta tag, so it lives here.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
